#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:7
#: b320456482ae4c06a86649aef0b828ec
msgid ""
"MAVExplorer is a log exploration tool. It is based on the same concepts as "
"mavgraph, but is interactive, and supports a community contribution model "
"for pre-defined graphs."
msgstr "MAVExplorer 是一个日志探索工具。它基于与 mavgraph 相同的概念，但具有交互性，并支持预定义图表的社区贡献模式。"

