#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:65
#: d20f0374c8184ca2a969fee17bddf1e0
msgid "Starting MAVExplorer"
msgstr "启动 MAVExplorer"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:67
#: a122669858a64823b47ea6e4c430ffff
msgid ""
"To start MAVExplorer just run it with a filename as an argument. It will "
"also start without a filename, and log file loaded later via the MAVExplorer"
" menu's \"Open\" item:"
msgstr ""
"要启动 MAVExplorer，只需将文件名作为参数运行即可。也可以不带文件名启动，之后通过 MAVExplorer 菜单的「Open」项加载日志文件："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:73
#: 793de7a90b4b44a5a7d1e75e54784d57
msgid ""
"it supports MAVLink telemetry logs, or DataFlash Logs. After starting it you"
" will end up with two windows, like this:"
msgstr "它支持 MAVLink 数传日志或 DataFlash 日志。启动后您将看到两个窗口，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:79
#: 62fe973afe3f4fb1af3cf298079c80c5
msgid ""
"The bottom window is the \"console\" and has your menus and the status "
"messages. The top window is your terminal, and has the \"MAV>\" prompt for "
"typing commands. The result of typing \"help\" is shown listing the "
"commands."
msgstr "底部窗口是「控制台」，包含菜单和状态消息。顶部窗口是您的终端，有用于输入命令的「MAV>」提示符。输入「help」的结果将列出命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:83
#: bf12aeb76a1c4c11bd4e658e17682f88
msgid ""
"be careful with spaces in log filenames. Use quotes around the filename if "
"needed."
msgstr "注意日志文件名中的空格。如有需要，请在文件名周围使用引号。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:86
#: 123d49fc8db24ab795a14e91b9fde5ec
msgid "Using pre-defined graphs"
msgstr "使用预定义图表"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:88
#: f74aa5b4865e45de89990a3786d702f4
msgid ""
"MAVExplorer comes with an extensive set of pre-defined graphs. Those graphs "
"appear in the Graphs menu in the console. Only graphs that are relevant for "
"the log you are viewing will appear in the menus."
msgstr "MAVExplorer 提供了大量预定义图表。这些图表出现在控制台的「Graphs」菜单中。菜单中只显示与您当前查看的日志相关的图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:92
#: 985c08a72fba4d35a82caf76bcb6b054
msgid ""
"To display a graph just choose it in the Graphs menu. You can display "
"several graphs at once if you want to."
msgstr "要显示图表，只需在「Graphs」菜单中选择即可。如需要，您也可以同时显示多个图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:99
#: 46e92355dc5541deac29c07ce8d69aae
msgid "Graphing Manually"
msgstr "手动绘图"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:101
#: 85c53d13dfe84dd5be7b8520f11d1ff2
msgid ""
"You can also graph any data from the log using the graph command in the "
"terminal at the MAV> prompt. Just type graph followed by the expression. For"
" example:"
msgstr "您也可以在「MAV>」提示符下使用终端中的 graph 命令绘制日志中的任何数据。只需输入 graph 后跟表达式即可。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:109
#: 466df36ca9ff4964ae16b32ab0b57765
msgid ""
"to help you create graphs quickly you can use the TAB key to complete and "
"list available messages and fields. For example, if you did this:"
msgstr "为了帮助您快速创建图表，可以使用 TAB 键补全并列出可用的消息和字段。例如，如果您执行："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:112
#: a001c6fab0e648e7920b3ab4b4ff2e73
msgid "graph <TAB><TAB>"
msgstr "graph <TAB><TAB>"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:114
#: 6b02a8d8e7c24ca1a507ddcc356657c5
msgid "you would see something like this:"
msgstr "您会看到如下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:119
#: 405de8d8e628462c8da761698a67fd3b
msgid ""
"the list of possible message names has been listed. If you type part of the "
"message name you want then you can use <TAB> to complete the name."
msgstr "已列出可能的消息名称。如果您输入所需消息名称的一部分，则可以使用 <TAB> 补全该名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:122
#: 7f3d391cfa5d48f3a7ad5881ab80e7ca
msgid ""
"After the message name you need to type a '.' followed by a field name. "
"Again you can TAB complete, for example:"
msgstr "在消息名称之后，您需要输入「.」再跟字段名。同样可以使用 TAB 补全，例如："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:128
#: f886ee33b4dc47aebfd20e5349506113
msgid ""
"You can do this for multiple fields in one graph, allowing you to construct "
"complex graphs quickly."
msgstr "您可以在一个图表中对多个字段执行此操作，从而快速构建复杂图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:131
#: 2cf14a6eed474202877f601e1ad69885
msgid ""
"Some messages have ``Instance`` fields, for storing data of multiple "
"instances of sensors, e.g. the ``RFND`` log message. In such cases, an "
"instance number must be specified while graphing, else values from all the "
"instances will be combined in a single graph."
msgstr ""
"某些消息具有 ``Instance`` 字段，用于存储多个传感器实例的数据，例如 ``RFND`` "
"日志消息。在这种情况下，绘图时必须指定实例编号，否则所有实例的值将合并在单个图表中。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:138
#: 7b946cefb6a74105a66ecdd7e6f03cfd
msgid "Modifying pre-defined graphs"
msgstr "修改预定义图表"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:140
#: 53a44cd648a54becad7f5f7b078fe3c3
msgid ""
"Whenever you use a pre-defined graph the graph expression gets added to your"
" command line history. So you can just hit enter to refresh the history then"
" up arrow to bring up the graph expression of the pre-defined graph you just"
" displayed. You can then add new fields or editing existing fields and hit "
"enter to display the new graph."
msgstr ""
"每当您使用预定义图表时，图表表达式会被添加到您的命令行历史记录中。因此，只需按回车键刷新历史记录，然后按上方向键调出刚才显示的预定义图表的表达式。然后您可以添加新字段或编辑现有字段，按回车键显示新图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:146
#: b8d5baf82f7f4dac9047fa5eb62239e8
msgid ""
"You can also save any graph you have just displayed using the \"Save Graph\""
" menu item under the \"Display\" menu:"
msgstr "您也可以使用「Display」菜单下的「Save Graph」菜单项保存刚刚显示的任何图表："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:152
#: 64e4b9fb247d46a7afb151dcdaf57248
msgid ""
"You can edit the name and description of the graph then press \"Save\" and "
"your graph will be added to your set of pre-defined graphs. You can also use"
" the \"Test\" button to test a graph before saving."
msgstr "您可以编辑图表的名称和描述，然后按「Save」，您的图表将被添加到预定义图表集合中。您也可以使用「Test」按钮在保存前测试图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:156
#: 0d0d4dec56dd411ba1436232229479c3
msgid ""
"Note that the / separators in the name of the graph control how the graph "
"will appear in the Graphs menu tree. So for example if you save a graph with"
" a name of \"Copter/Analysis/WPNav Analysis\" then a \"WPNav Analysis\" menu"
" item will be added to the Copter->Analysis submenu, automatically creating "
"the submenus as needed."
msgstr ""
"注意，图表名称中的「/」分隔符控制图表在「Graphs」菜单树中的显示方式。例如，如果您以「Copter/Analysis/WPNav "
"Analysis」为名称保存图表，则「WPNav Analysis」菜单项将被添加到 Copter->Analysis "
"子菜单中，并自动创建所需的子菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:162
#: 69e8c33704df462bb1cdc2c2a7564573
msgid ""
"Also note that each graph expression should be on a line by itself. If you "
"have multiple lines for the expressions then they will be considered as "
"alternative expressions (to cope with different types of logs)."
msgstr "另请注意，每个图表表达式应单独占一行。如果表达式有多行，则它们将被视为替代表达式（以应对不同类型的日志）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:167
#: b2d05055a0874a62817597035b3db3fb
msgid "Graph Expressions"
msgstr "图表表达式"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:169
#: 62b94e4c3caa4a748d76443f71d2285c
msgid ""
"Graph expressions are arbitrary python expressions. You can use any "
"functions from the python maths library, plus any functions from the "
"mavextra module in pymavlink or your own mavextra module."
msgstr ""
"图表表达式是任意 Python 表达式。您可以使用 Python 数学库中的任何函数，以及 pymavlink 的 mavextra 模块或您自己的 "
"mavextra 模块中的任何函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:173
#: 06ace0c314c045babc0cbe78ac5ebfcc
msgid ""
"This allows you to easily graph mathematical expressions combining any "
"variables in the log. For example:"
msgstr "这使您可以轻松绘制将日志中任意变量组合的数学表达式。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:180
#: ecdd7361a8324130a20af9117f695a60
msgid ""
"that will graph the total magnetic field strength (the length of the compass"
" vector)."
msgstr "这将绘制总磁场强度（罗盘向量的长度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:183
#: 01f51eeae35048338c8ca677428941f8
msgid "Another very useful express is a low pass filter on the data:"
msgstr "另一个非常有用的表达式是对数据进行低通滤波："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:189
#: 4ad2847e01db4f1dacf731f7af5c382c
msgid ""
"syntax is lowpass(variable to filter,tag,alpha) where \"tag\" is an "
"arbitrary reference number, and \"alpha\" is weighting of current filter "
"output, 1-alpha is the weighting of the present variable's value this "
"sample, and these are summed to provide the next filter output sample."
msgstr ""
"语法为 lowpass(要滤波的变量, 标签, alpha)，其中「标签」是任意参考编号，「alpha」是当前滤波器输出的权重，1-alpha "
"是本次采样中当前变量值的权重，两者之和提供下一个滤波器输出采样。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:195
#: 7870db2b9e0645eeaa819dd846c4c3b0
msgid "Right and Left scales"
msgstr "左右刻度"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:197
#: c78ab6bf7c3d467598fa4a3640596b21
msgid ""
"The default is that graphed values are shown on the left hand axis scale, "
"all scaled together. To plane a field on the right hand scale just use "
"\":2\" on the end of the field name. For example:"
msgstr "默认情况下，绘制的值显示在左轴刻度上，全部一起缩放。要将字段放在右侧刻度上，只需在字段名称末尾加上「:2」。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:205
#: bb180afb9089492a9788e7bd861d1c05
msgid "Selecting by Flight Mode"
msgstr "按飞行模式选择"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:207
#: fcedcaa0a64c45a38d516b745cf828a5
msgid ""
"It is often useful to select only a part of a flight based on the flight "
"mode. To do that use the FlightMode menu:"
msgstr "根据飞行模式仅选择飞行的某一部分通常很有用。为此，使用「FlightMode」菜单："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:213
#: 85f15b98ba1945c88a375465fbbe61a2
msgid ""
"The FlightMode menu will show all the flight mode changes in your flight, "
"along with how many seconds it was in that mode. You can select which parts "
"of the flight to include in subsequent graphs by selecting the appropriate "
"flight menu items. If none are selected then the whole log is graphed."
msgstr ""
"「FlightMode」菜单将显示您飞行中的所有飞行模式切换，以及在该模式下飞行的秒数。您可以通过选择相应的飞行菜单项来选择后续图表中包含哪些飞行部分。如果没有选择任何内容，则对整个日志绘图。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:220
#: 04a6c8052e334d3ebf0eb23bb44a29cb
msgid "Adding Conditions"
msgstr "添加条件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:222
#: 7845b24d6d2d495bb7c319d2e32fe512
msgid ""
"You can restrict graphs based on conditions expressed as python expressions "
"of the available log variables. For example, if you wanted to only graph "
"where the GPS speed was above 4 meters/second in a DataFlash log you could "
"do this:"
msgstr ""
"您可以基于以可用日志变量的 Python 表达式形式表达的条件来限制图表。例如，如果您只想在 DataFlash 日志中绘制 GPS 速度超过 4 "
"米/秒的数据，可以执行："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:231
#: 772ab057da9945ba9b570033571f86b3
msgid "to clear the condition set it to the empty string"
msgstr "要清除条件，将其设置为空字符串"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:238
#: f5f14ccf7023448d9acc939bb3a888a1
msgid "Displaying a Map"
msgstr "显示地图"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:240
#: 575f32ca4f66430a8b40af45a0f02d63
msgid "You can display a map showing your flight path using the map command:"
msgstr "您可以使用 map 命令显示飞行路径的地图："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:246
#: f267f6a133864ff496b6f6fc0b560af7
msgid "or selecting the MAP menu item from the Display menu."
msgstr "或从「Display」菜单中选择「MAP」菜单项。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:248
#: c46a90844aec46f9a643d99e0b59be2f
msgid "A map will pop up following the current condition, like this:"
msgstr "地图将根据当前条件弹出，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:253
#: 8d79c9c06ae74cf3af6d80bd051d0679
msgid ""
"You can zoom in and out using the mouse and the scroll wheel or + and - "
"keys. You can measure distances using two left clicks. Colours are used to "
"indicate flight modes."
msgstr "您可以使用鼠标和滚轮或 + 和 - 键进行缩放。您可以通过两次鼠标左键单击来测量距离。颜色用于表示飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:257
#: 5c2cbb56a71a4e18ac70d5d5f4e307f3
msgid ""
"You can optionally supply message types to use for the map. Any message type"
" that has latitude and longitude elements can be used. For example, to show "
"a map from both the GPS and POS messages in an ArduPilot log file you can "
"do:"
msgstr ""
"您可以选择性地提供用于地图的消息类型。任何具有经纬度元素的消息类型均可使用。例如，要在 ArduPilot 日志文件中同时显示来自 GPS 和 POS "
"消息的地图，可以执行："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:266
#: c54833e44df746c2b8f4bb506f2c8c6a
msgid "The multiple tracks will be shown with sequentially darker colours."
msgstr "多条轨迹将以逐渐加深的颜色显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:269
#: 2287e794ce224cd4b4f5e53d9fa6fca3
msgid "Graph Definition XML files"
msgstr "图表定义 XML 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:271
#: 7c890e1aaa9c41b1b4cfa2c987ff210d
msgid ""
"You will probably find it useful to add your own pre-defined graph "
"definitions for commonly used graphs. These pre-defined graphs are created "
"in XML files, and can be shared with other users of MAVExplorer."
msgstr "您可能会发现为常用图表添加自己的预定义图表定义很有用。这些预定义图表在 XML 文件中创建，并可与其他 MAVExplorer 用户共享。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:275
#: aa4b46b25b384e92828b15bc8838129f
msgid ""
"The quickest way to create these graphs is to use the \"Save Graph\" "
"feature, but you can also create the XML files manually using your favourite"
" text editor."
msgstr "创建这些图表最快的方法是使用「Save Graph」功能，但您也可以使用您喜欢的文本编辑器手动创建 XML 文件。"

