msgstr "在当前目录中查找名为「mavgraphs.xml」的文件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:289
#: d66716986c2640edba36396eddbb3284
msgid ""
"in your home directory it looks for any XML files in your $HOME/.mavproxy/ "
